# The compose build context is the repository root (deploy/compose.yaml has
# `context: ..`), so everything not listed here is uploaded to the daemon on every
# build. Local Room data must never be part of that: .agentchatroom/ holds the
# SQLite Room database (live Session tokens, message bodies, absolute machine
# paths), and docs/, evidence/ and .workbuddy/ hold local notes and verification
# output. The rest is either build output the image creates itself or repository
# tooling the image never reads.
#
# Kept deliberately because deploy/Dockerfile COPYs them: pyproject.toml,
# README.md, LICENSE, src/, deploy/config.server.example.toml.
.agentchatroom/
docs/
evidence/
.workbuddy/
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github/
.venv/
venv/
build/
dist/
packaging/
python/
scripts/
tests/
*.egg-info/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
.env
.pytest_cache/
coverage*
